  unitName: Dark Spirit
  unitId: 60121
  unitNumber: 182
  description: A spirit that rules dark, one of the six elements created by the gods.
    It speaks politely, but it's hard to know what it's thinking as its speech lacks
    feeling. It speaks as if it is obedient, but may act completely opposite. It's
    hard to handle, but as legend speaks of their power to unlock the potential of
    others, they are often sought out by Summoners.
  summonDesc: Thank you, Summoner.<br>For good or for evil,<br>use my power as you
    please.
